---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us | ApprovedTilers.co.uk" description="Learn about the UK's most trusted network of master tilers.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Raising the Standard of UK Tiling</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg">ApprovedTilers.co.uk was founded to solve a simple problem: finding a reliable, highly-skilled tiler is too difficult. We eliminate the risk of rogue traders by maintaining a strictly vetted network of master tilers across the UK.</p>
      
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Our Vetting Process</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        <li><strong>Insurance Verified:</strong> Every tiler must prove active £2M+ Public Liability Insurance.</li>
        <li><strong>Portfolio Review:</strong> We strictly assess previous workmanship, specifically checking for laser alignment, grout consistency, and proper subfloor preparation.</li>
        <li><strong>Fixed Price Promise:</strong> Our network members sign an agreement to never charge hidden "rogue" fees. The quoted price is the final price.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
